      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#findOne(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findOne(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,org.springframework.data.domain.Sort)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example, Sort)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findAll(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,org.springframework.data.domain.Pageable)\" tabindex=\"0\">findAll(Example, Pageable)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#count(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">count(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#exists(org.springframework.data.domain.Example)\" tabindex=\"0\">exists(Example)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#findBy(org.springframework.data.domain.Example,java.util.function.Function)\" tabindex=\"0\">findBy(Example, Function)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
