    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>sort</code> - the <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> specification to sort the results by, may be <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>, must not be\n         null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>1.10</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>sort</code> - 用于对结果进行排序的 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 规范，可以是 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html#unsorted()\"><code>Sort.unsorted()</code></a>，不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>所有匹配给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 的实体。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>1.10</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a single entity matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a> if none was found.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - if the Example yields more than one result.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不得为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的接口\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的实体，或者如果未找到则返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html#empty()\" title=\"java.util 中的类或接口\"><code>Optional.empty()</code></a>。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\">IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</a></code> - 如果 Example 产生多个结果。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>pageable</code> - the pageable to request a paged result, can be <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>, must not be\n         null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>a <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> of entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不得为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>pageable</code> - 用于请求分页结果的 pageable，可以是 <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>，不得为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>一个包含与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的实体的 <a href=\"../../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - must not be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>queryFunction</code> - the query function defining projection, sorting, and the result type</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>2.6</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>example</code> - 不能为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>queryFunction</code> - 定义投影、排序和结果类型的查询函数</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>所有与给定 <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> 匹配的实体。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>2.6</dd>",
      "count": 1
